<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to consolidate the Acts authorising the
creation and issue of Inscribed Stock and making provisions auxiliary
thereto.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="preamble" id="frnt-preamble">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="frnt-preamble"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid"
value="_41daa8fd-3672-49f6-9dea-69f466fa3316"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head><heading id="frnt-preamble-he"
guid="_fc5cd62f-52f0-4e63-8e71-da779904016b"><b>Preamble</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Whereas by the Imperial Act intituled the <legref
jurisd="IMP" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Colonial Stock
Act 1877</i></name></legref>, it is enacted that on provision being made by
the legislature of a Colony and otherwise for the inscription and transfer in
a register kept in the United Kingdom by some bank Colonial officer or person
(therein referred to as the registrar) of any stock forming the whole or part
of the public debt of such Colony and upon a certain declaration in respect of
the Stock therein specified being made and recorded as in the said Act
mentioned that Act shall apply to the Stock so specified: And whereas it is
expedient to authorise the creation and issue of Inscribed Stock within the
meaning and subject to the provisions of the said Act and the making of
agreements in respect of such Stock and for other matters in connection
therewith:</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="enact" id="frnt-enact">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="frnt-enact"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid"
value="_119443eb-2ecb-4375-be34-ab643d2be3ea"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Be it therefore enacted by the King&#8217;s Most
Excellent Majesty by and with the advice and consent of the Legislative
Council and Legislative Assembly of New South Wales in Parliament assembled
and by the authority of the same as follows:</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cd67342a-cc30-4f19-9289-b2b527f11262"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading id="sec.1-he"
guid="_b1d1ce78-1ba8-4234-bc7c-53e390bc9320"><b>Name of
Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1902-079"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Inscribed Stock Act
1902</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f65fedc6-2c45-4141-8d04-6becd23ef450"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading id="sec.2-he"
guid="_f8046ab7-4b0d-47ba-9939-1dfaf67e0268"><b>Repeal</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Acts mentioned in the Schedule hereto are to
the extent therein mentioned hereby repealed.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0561d72e-4ac0-4ccc-9bde-335769c35ed1"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading id="sec.3-he"
guid="_d0381cd1-999b-409a-a4a4-7af7ba995c0c"><b>Existing
officers</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">All registrars agents commissioners and other
officers appointed under either of the Acts hereby repealed and holding office
at the time of the passing of this Act shall remain in office as if this Act
had been in force at the time they were appointed and they had been appointed
hereunder and this Act shall apply to them accordingly.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_91061dd4-8f22-4d11-87c7-9478397431dc"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading id="sec.4-he"
guid="_db6f9a5d-ddbd-41a6-9e1e-b7933809a383"><b>Existing
regulations</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">All regulations duly made under the authority of
either of the Acts hereby repealed and in force at the time of the passing of
this Act shall be deemed to be and to have been duly made under the
corresponding provisions of this Act and as if this Act had been in force when
the same were made.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5cda3e61-f1ad-4cf0-9735-d488807f179a"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading id="sec.5-he"
guid="_9c4f9f13-a371-4fbe-98d4-5ac974a0ac08"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act unless the context or subject-matter
otherwise indicates or requires:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm id="def.Stock"
guid="_bce418ee-83c1-4f40-acc7-1554306a2527"
type="definition"><b><i>Stock</i></b></defterm> means Inscribed
Stock.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f8f05a34-f650-4d3c-95ef-c82e91d347ce"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading id="sec.6-he"
guid="_88e05f01-700c-4d54-8422-eaaccf8e842a"><b>Loans may be raised in the
form of Stock</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Whenever by any Act now or hereafter in force
power is given to the Governor to raise any sums of money by way of loan for
the public service of New South Wales the Governor may raise the whole or any
portion of such sums in the form of Stock.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d8e13012-ca1b-461a-a21a-f4da87361d9c"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading id="sec.7-he"
guid="_da278d37-63d6-48af-86d1-56960d11f24c"><b>Conditions attached to issue
of Stock &#38;c</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">All such Stock shall be styled &#8220;New South
Wales Stock&#8221; and subject to the provisions of this Act shall:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.7-para1.a" guid="_ebdeb4dc-2811-4203-a8ff-8bb490620f7d"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">be issued in such amounts in such manner and at
such times</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-para1.b" guid="_92277fd0-0980-4af0-a87a-b94cd2bf3ba9"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">bear interest at such rate not exceeding four per
centum per annum</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-para1.c" guid="_2dd0151b-3f25-40bd-8ffd-42de297af7e8"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">be redeemable at such times and on such
conditions and</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-para1.d" guid="_b7abb4a3-3884-4083-8c4c-fa46f7eb32e5"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">be subject to such terms and
conditions</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">as the Governor before exercising the aforesaid power
from time to time determines and appoints.</txt></block>
<note id="sec.7-note" guid="_890982e0-db82-44fe-a144-d43cde0bb9f5"
type="editorial"><heading id="sec.7-note-he"
guid="_88e1b0d7-321b-414e-938f-42b887ca9568"><b>Editorial
note&#8212;</b></heading>

<tier type="clause" id="sec.7-note-sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-note-sec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a33e5050-7a8b-4f46-93b4-0ff8538f22ba"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 2 of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Loans (Interest) Act 1915</i></name>
No 34</legref> reads as follows:</txt>
<fragment format="para" style="indent">
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may, under any Acts now in force
authorising the raising of loans, raise such loans by the issue of debentures,
inscribed or funded stock, or Treasury bills, bearing interest at rates
exceeding four per centum per annum, notwithstanding any provisions to the
contrary in such Acts.</txt></block></fragment>
</block></tier>


<tier type="clause" id="sec.7-note-sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-note-sec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a695227e-c524-4df1-b6a6-0a77aa228849"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Loans (Interest) Act 1915</i></name>
No 34</legref> was repealed by Sch 1 to the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Statute Law Revision Act
1937</i></name> No 35</legref> effective from 23 December
1937.</txt></block></tier>
</note>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1bc2a62b-ec10-44d4-af8f-f5a6aa0add52"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading id="sec.8-he"
guid="_81ce7650-9bd3-498b-a88e-59108652a901"><b>Conversion of debentures into
Stock</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may exercise all or any of the
following powers:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.8-para1.a" guid="_fff5d211-9c86-4ce0-8a08-3ad20d48c731"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">declare all or any of the debentures issued under
the authority of any Act to be convertible into Stock redeemable at such times
and subject to such terms and conditions as he before the creation thereof
determines and appoints</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.8-para1.b" guid="_dfba210c-7f99-4d6a-a38e-4e4e68bfb161"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">authorise the issue of an equivalent amount of
such Stock in exchange for such debentures</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.8-para1.c" guid="_e52e9c22-6d88-4d84-b617-28550143f55a"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">authorise on such conditions as he determines the
creation and issue of any Stock for the purpose of converting any outstanding
debentures into Stock and of paying any expenses in connection with such
conversion or in carrying out the provisions of this
Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6e843d61-856d-4239-9047-e6126077eba5"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading id="sec.9-he"
guid="_00924ad1-81e1-4eba-8a55-f5cc103e6978"><b>How conversion may be
effected</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8c3b0a90-a576-4800-abd2-74ad9523548a"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any such conversion of debentures into Stock may
be effected either:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.a" guid="_0f75f909-a842-46d6-8728-a861aaefcb4e"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">by arrangement with the holders of such
debentures or</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.b" guid="_9de3f4df-a9b6-4a1a-9c5e-60e109aa9e56"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">by purchase thereof out of moneys raised by the
sale of new Stock or</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.c" guid="_1107e5ec-fbfa-4212-b63b-354a53db5d1a"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">partly in the one way and partly in the
other.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_418e385f-0aad-4ab4-b0c8-4a101cbc11b0"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this Act shall authorise an increase
in the authorised amount of any loan save only where debentures exchanged for
Stock bear a higher rate of interest than such Stock in which case an
additional amount of Stock may be issued to make up the difference in current
saleable value between such Stock and debentures.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d2ab57f7-d3da-4a03-8941-669d9d55e162"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading id="sec.10-he"
guid="_e5748d1b-9f2f-4b00-891c-c62426c3e096"><b>Principal and interest on
Stock how payable</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The principal money due and payable in respect of
any Stock together with all interest payable thereon shall be paid by the
Treasurer out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9af59a0d-5f7d-4408-ab2d-212f4ab2c98d"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading id="sec.11-he"
guid="_6c3c24a3-7368-4123-8e25-1883d81c207e"><b>Agreement with bank in London
for issue of Stock &#38;c</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may from time to time enter into
such agreements as to him seem fit with any bank carrying on business in
London and willing to act as registrar to provide for all or any of the
following matters:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.11-para1.a" guid="_d8fc7229-2daa-42b1-b859-5fd1f3d6924b"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the inscription and issue of
Stock</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.11-para1.b" guid="_b83970e2-ba41-40c6-9469-1794119d5b44"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">effecting the conversion of debentures into Stock
and regulating transfers of Stock</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.11-para1.c" guid="_1d65885d-c9dd-4f04-a9e4-7c2064137d80"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">paying interest on Stock</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.11-para1.d" guid="_5dba0de7-c5a5-486d-b41d-1f871ebf6732"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">issuing Stock certificates and as often as
occasion requires reinscribing or reissuing such
certificates</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.11-para1.e" guid="_3e2fbb21-0bbd-4769-a1e3-9ee00827b51a"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">receiving all moneys raised under this Act and
paying such moneys into the Public Account with the bank duly appointed in
that behalf</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.11-para1.f" guid="_ef8d3eee-526d-4449-bfe9-4eae5e63c825"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">issuing scrip for deposits on loans raised by the
sale of Stock</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.11-para1.g" guid="_9bdfdd23-76d3-4a99-8671-694193cbe198"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">paying off capital of Stock or
loans</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.11-para1.h" guid="_5d14f817-11f2-4ca5-82bd-79d46dc01508"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(h)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">conducting generally all business connected with
Stock or loans</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.11-para1.i" guid="_74cfad73-2a58-48c1-963b-55cc9ecab034"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the protection and remuneration of any such bank
under and in respect of any such agreement.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.12">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a72ea695-f626-4f0c-8923-6c0a916435ad"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>12</no><heading id="sec.12-he"
guid="_7051d64c-35bc-4f72-aafe-9a658724b849"><b>Effect of agreement with
bank</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Every agreement made with any such bank shall be
as valid and effectual as if the terms thereof had been enacted by this Act
and all remuneration payable thereunder to such bank shall be a charge on and
payable out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.13">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5694e21b-6d7b-4ef9-9565-c7591475d428"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>13</no><heading id="sec.13-he"
guid="_1a86ce23-9bcb-470b-91db-c431c3b39624"><b>Treasurer shall pay amount of
judgment in England in respect of stock of New South
Wales</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where in any legal proceedings in a court in the
United Kingdom in relation to the register of Stock of New South Wales or to
an entry in or omission from that register or to a right or title to or
interest in any such Stock or any dividend thereon or upon any petition of
right in England in relation to such Stock or dividend presented by any person
claiming to be interested in the same the registrar appointed in pursuance of
the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Inscribed Stock Act of 1883</i></name></legref> or this Act
is liable under the Imperial Act intituled the <legref jurisd="IMP" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Colonial Stock Act
1877</i></name></legref> in respect of any judgment decree rule or order of
the court the Treasurer shall issue his warrant for the payment from the
Consolidated Revenue Fund of such amount as may be necessary to satisfy any
such judgment decree or order.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.14">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f0987e1e-caa8-4f0b-8b86-582d930abdb4"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>14</no><heading id="sec.14-he"
guid="_93a93f78-a633-4c78-abc3-5b07759f9e2a"><b>Appointment of agents in
London</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_778c7d68-d053-4941-829c-c6373170ad29"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may appoint two or more persons in
London as agents for the purposes of this Act of whom one shall be the
Agent-General of New South Wales and may empower such agents or any one or
more of them to exercise such powers by this Act exercisable by the Governor
as the Governor may authorise or direct.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3e86806b-de70-435b-8723-56e452149cbd"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Every such appointment of an agent shall be
notified to any bank with which any agreement has been entered into under this
Act and the power and authority of every such agent shall continue in force
until such bank has received a notice signed by the Governor of the
termination of the agent&#8217;s appointment.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.15">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.15"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_68628f83-f25b-4b35-804a-e26afe6ca19d"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>15</no><heading id="sec.15-he"
guid="_7519811c-dd72-4769-86c9-977492b3403e"><b>Saving
clause</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this Act and nothing done under this
Act except by agreement shall abridge or in any way affect the rights or
remedies which any person would have had against the Consolidated Revenue Fund
or otherwise if this Act had not been passed.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.16">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f9db58f1-ee5f-4609-8d4d-22e0338844cf"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>16</no><heading id="sec.16-he"
guid="_de1fa652-357e-45bd-ae5e-4c5186203056"><b>Appointment of Commissioners
to deal with Stock for Colonial investors</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.16-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e06fa50d-9f3a-41a8-bcf1-99b568e60bde"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may appoint two or more persons to
be commissioners to accept transfer of and deal with stock inscribed upon the
register in London for the purpose of enabling persons in New South Wales to
hold Stock under this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.16-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cb4119bd-932d-47de-9276-aa52d71652b2"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations for carrying
the provisions of this section into effect and all such regulations on being
published in the Gazette shall be valid in law.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.17">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.17"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_05e6db0c-4658-4407-9a74-f1092d76cb65"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>17</no><heading id="sec.17-he"
guid="_dcf5a432-0677-46e3-9c2a-f09174fe4df7"><b>Matters to be reported to
Parliament</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Treasurer shall within thirty days after the
meeting of Parliament in each year lay before both Houses of Parliament</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.17-para1.i" guid="_648cc72a-e0d7-4956-b576-bcd45a72e753"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a report showing</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.17-para1.i-para2.a" guid="_db98b7f6-a309-4eb0-bbd5-e000930ad697"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the particulars of every creation and inscription
of stock whether created for the purpose of raising a loan or for the
conversion of outstanding debentures</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.17-para1.i-para2.b" guid="_3443c75c-e75c-4ad1-8f31-697f74d2bb88"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the capital amount of such
Stock</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.17-para1.i-para2.c" guid="_3b0480f1-18df-45a7-8b0d-71f03f0cf41c"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the rate of interest thereon</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.17-para1.i-para2.d" guid="_60751baa-3c0b-4b3b-9011-4c93dd7a4115"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the currency and condition of redemption
thereof</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.17-para1.i-para2.e" guid="_dc7022ab-71ab-4956-a07a-d7f331c88bf9"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the particulars of every redemption or payment of
the capital amount of any loan or of any portion thereof
and</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li id="sec.17-para1.ii" guid="_273f81ff-7742-4a80-8e8d-3ad1d8129d36"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">copies of all agreements appointments rules and
regulations effected entered into or made under the authority of this act
prior to such date of meeting.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>
</content>


